 <div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><span class="text-secondary">Minimum monthly income</span><strong>₱5,000.00</strong></div>
 <div class="small text-secondary loan-verification-note">Your proof of income will be reviewed by an administrator.</div>
 </div>
 <div class="loan-cost-breakdown mt-4">
 <div class="fw-bold">Installation Cost Breakdown</div>
 <div class="loan-cost-row"><span class="text-secondary">Water Meter</span><strong>₱250.00</strong></div>
 <div class="loan-cost-row"><span class="text-secondary">Hose</span><strong>₱150.00</strong></div>
 <div class="loan-cost-row"><span class="text-secondary">Other Materials</span><strong>₱100.00</strong></div>
